{"comment_text": {"ja33:0.1": "", "ja33:0.2": "", "ja33:0.3": "", "ja33:0.4": "", "ja33:1.1": "A flock of birds escape the hunter by lifting off his net in unison. But the hunter knows that when they stop cooperating they will be his. ", "ja33:1.2": "", "ja33:1.3": "", "ja33:1.4": "", "ja33:2.1": ""}, "html_text": {"ja33:0.1": "<article id='ja33'><header><ul><li class='division'>{}</li>", "ja33:0.2": "<li>{}</li>", "ja33:0.3": "<li>{}</li></ul>", "ja33:0.4": "<h1 class='sutta-title'>{}</h1></header>", "ja33:1.1": "<blockquote class='gatha'><p><span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja33:1.2": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja33:1.3": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja33:1.4": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span></p></blockquote>", "ja33:2.1": "<p class='endsutta'>{}</p></article>"}, "root_text": {"ja33:0.1": "Jātaka ", "ja33:0.2": "Ekakanipāta ", "ja33:0.3": "Kulāvakavagga ", "ja33:0.4": "3. Sammodamānajātaka ", "ja33:1.1": "“Sammodamānā gacchanti, ", "ja33:1.2": "jālamādāya pakkhino; ", "ja33:1.3": "Yadā te vivadissanti, ", "ja33:1.4": "tadā ehinti me vasan”ti. ", "ja33:2.1": "Sammodamānajātakaṁ tatiyaṁ. "}, "translation_text": {"ja33:0.1": "Stories of Past Lives 33 ", "ja33:0.2": "The Book of the Ones ", "ja33:0.3": "Nests ", "ja33:0.4": "Agreement: a past life story ", "ja33:1.1": "In agreement, the birds fly, ", "ja33:1.2": "taking away the net. ", "ja33:1.3": "But when they start arguing ", "ja33:1.4": "they’ll come under my sway. ", "ja33:2.1": ""}, "reference_text": {"ja33:0.1": "", "ja33:0.2": "", "ja33:0.3": "", "ja33:0.4": "", "ja33:1.1": "csp1ed22.9, csp2ed22.9, ms22J_72, msdiv33, pts-vp-pli1.209", "ja33:1.2": "", "ja33:1.3": "", "ja33:1.4": "", "ja33:2.1": "ms22J_73"}, "keys_order": ["ja33:0.1", "ja33:0.2", "ja33:0.3", "ja33:0.4", "ja33:1.1", "ja33:1.2", "ja33:1.3", "ja33:1.4", "ja33:2.1"]}